// health and one about to die looked the same; only the bar said so. Every machine now wears three bolted steel plates over
// its body (GFXPLATE: where its body is, in units of its own size, so a bigger one wears bigger plates). Below 75 percent
// health the first plate comes off, below 50 the second, below 25 the last: each one breaks away as a piece of debris that
// tumbles off in an arc, lands, lies on the ground for ten seconds and fades. A plate once shed stays shed (GFXSHED, a
// WeakMap on the drawing side, never written onto the machine), and a machine first seen already hurt starts without the
